    <Requirement id="ER-P016-03" level="1" requirementType="safety">
      <sysml:Name>带压管路防护</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>冷却水系统的带压管路应设置安全阀或泄压装置，防止超压爆裂；系统应设置高温报警和自动保护（报警→自动减速→停机），保护逻辑应符合IACS UR E10要求。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P016" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SOLAS-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-CCS-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-LDR-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>超压爆裂可能导致人员伤亡和设备损坏。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查安全阀/泄压装置的设计选型，确认整定压力不超过管路设计压力。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间模拟高温工况，确认报警、减速、停机三级保护动作正确，触发点按主机厂家Technical Data确认。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【带压管路防护】，来自原始需求「带压管路」。E-SOLAS-COOL-001支撑备用泵和报警要求；E-CCS-COOL-001支撑高温报警和自动保护；E-SUPP-LDR-001支撑三级保护逻辑。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
