    <Requirement id="ER-P016-04" level="1" requirementType="safety">
      <sysml:Name>化学处理液防护</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>冷却水系统应设置防泄漏和防溅射措施，包括但不限于：膨胀水箱溢流管不得排入大海；含铬、亚硝酸盐或乙二醇的废液应收集至专用收集箱并送岸上设施处理；系统应配备应急冲洗设施。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="inspection" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P016" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-ENV-001" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SYS-CORR-004" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SYS-CORR-003" supportStatus="supported_by_indirect_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>supported_by_indirect_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>化学处理液泄漏可能导致人员化学灼伤和环境污染。</RiskIfUnmet>
        <ApplicabilityConstraint>E-SYS-CORR-004和E-SYS-CORR-003基于MAN 49/60DF机型，其他厂家和机型应参照各自技术文件。</ApplicabilityConstraint>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查膨胀水箱溢流管去向，确认不排入大海。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>检查废液收集箱容量和排放接口，确认满足MARPOL要求。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>检查应急冲洗设施的位置和供水能力，按项目设计确认。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【化学处理液防护】，来自原始需求「化学处理液」。E-SUPP-ENV-001（MARPOL）直接给出了废液禁止排海和收集要求；E-SYS-CORR-004和E-SYS-CORR-003间接支撑了收集箱的设置。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
